{"Title":"Proposal for a legislative amendment to the Constitution relative to select boards","BillNumber":"S12","DocketNumber":"SD811","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WNB0","Name":"William N. Brownsberger","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WNB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T14:24:27.537"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WNB0","Name":"William N. Brownsberger","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WNB0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T14:24:27.5366667"},{"Id":"EDJ0","Name":"Edward J. Kennedy","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/EDJ0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-25T10:44:07.8633333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S12/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Proposal for Constitutional Amendment","Pinslip":"By Mr. Brownsberger, a petition (accompanied by proposal, Senate, No. 12) of William N. Brownsberger for a legislative amendment to the Constitution relative to select boards.  Municipalities and Regional Government.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Article II of Section II of Chapter I of Part the Second of the Constitution of the Commonwealth is hereby amended by striking out the word \"selectmen\", each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Article III of Section I of Chapter II of said Part the Second is hereby amended by striking out the word \"selectmen\", each time it appears, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 3. Article X of Chapter VI of said Part the Second is hereby amended by striking out the word \"selectmen\" and inserting in place thereof the following words:- select board.\r\n\tSECTION 4. Article II of the Articles of Amendment to the Constitution of the Commonwealth, as appearing in Article LXXXIX of said Articles of Amendment, is hereby amended by striking out the words \"board of selectmen\", each time they appear, and inserting in place thereof, in each instance, the following words:- select board.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J10","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J10"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}